{"_notes":["Locally added -- upstream pinmame-nvram-maps has no map for CSI.","Built from a 4-player game driven through the cabinet's own streamer.","current_player and current_ball are adjacent in CPU RAM at 0x0003443C and 0x0003443D, player low","Scores are 4 bytes on 8-byte centres from 0x021109F0. The sweep also offered 0x00033784 on 4-byte","centres in CPU RAM, reading 601,580 / 150,440 / 15,040 / 9,400 -- each roughly a quarter of the","one before, which is a scaled or derived set rather than a scoreboard. Scores live in NVRAM on","every SAM game measured, which is what settles it.","Five high score records from 0x02102B98, bounded by where the 16-bit checksum stops validating.","This game has no mode champions: the block ends at five and the machine's post-game DMD cycle","shows no champion entries, unlike Avatar, Dark Knight and Big Buck Hunter.","Only csi_240 is claimed; SAM addresses move between revisions.","Confirmed after the table exited: the map decodes that game as 4 players scoring 945,250 /","1,062,000 / 1,013,750 / 1,014,000.","game_over, tilted, tilt_warnings and credits come from a 783-frame recording of live memory","spanning an operator-menu session and a full game with a tilt on ball 1. The session also","adjustment indices 30 and 32 as the free_play-relative rule predicted.","0x0003446E is the status bitfield the other SAM games keep at ball+0x31, in a richer variant:","1 in attract, 38 (0x26) at the start of each ball, 18 (0x12) once the ball is in play, 20","(0x14) while tilted. game_over with mask 0x12 inverted decodes all four correctly in every one","of the 783 frames. Bit 0x04 is NOT a usable tilt mask here, unlike trn_174h and its siblings:","the ball-start value 38 carries it too. The tilt is bit 0x02 clearing during play.","tilt comes instead from 0x000390BC, a warning counter as on twenty4_150: 1 at the first warning","while scoring continued, 2 at the exact frame player 1's score froze at 43,500 -- frozen until","the ball ended -- and 0 at ball end. tilted is bit 0x02 of it, exact at the factory two-warning","setting; the raw counter is mapped for anyone who changes that.","credits at 0x0211100C, the ninth SAM game at that address: rose to 2 with the coins, fell to 1","at game start.","2026-11: tilted reads the status byte 0x0003446E (0x14, mask 0x1F). The warning counter","0x000390BC (still tilt_warnings) reaches 2 at the second warning, before the tilt.","2026-11: Master Volume and the A.1 (63) and A.2 (19) adjustments added from the ROM image","(README, 'Adjustments from the ROM').","Confirmed on a cabinet 2026-11-13 (ALP4K; two games, tilt on P1 ball 1): the ROM took one player","each time; 1,087,250 and 789,500, the records and the status byte (01, 26 ball served, 12, 14","tilted) matched the DMD."],"_fileformat":0.9,"_metadata":{"version":9,"license":"Open Data Commons Open Database License (ODbL) v1.0","copyright":["Copyright (C) 2026 by Wes Smith <evilwraith@gmail.com>"],"platform":"stern-sam.6e326d93","roms":["csi_240"],"validation":{"checksum":[{"_notes":"82 adjustments: 4-byte LE value, 1-byte checksum, 3 bytes 0xFF padding","label":"Adjustment {#} (checksum)","start":"0x02102008","length":5,"complement":true,"repeat":{"count":82,"step":8}},{"label":"Champion record {#} (checksum)","start":"0x2102B98","repeat":{"count":5,"step":32},"length":30,"bits":16,"complement":true},{"label":"Master Volume","start":"0x0211024C","end":"0x0211024D","complement":true}]},"values":{"no_yes":["NO","YES"],"credit_ticket_token":["CREDIT","TICKET","TOKEN"],"easy_medium_hard":["EASY","MEDIUM","HARD"]}},"checksum8":[{"label":"Free Play adjustment","start":"0x02102110","end":"0x02102114"},{"label":"Balls Per Game adjustment","start":"0x021020F8","end":"0x021020FC"},{"label":"Maximum Credits adjustment","start":"0x02102108","end":"0x0210210C"}],"game_state":{"player_count":{"label":"Player Count","encoding":"int","start":"0x02110900"},"free_play":{"label":"Free Play","encoding":"bool","start":"0x0210211